docs/*.xls
docs/*.docx
docs/*.pdf
/*.pdf
~$*

# 2. Test scenarios, test feedback, manual checklists / matrices
docs/testing/
docs/Test_Checklist*.md
docs/*Test_Matrix*.md

# 3. Decisions still waiting for the owner's confirmation
